<title>SWEDEN: Average rate 3.18 pct on Swedish T-bill auction.</title>
<headline>Average rate 3.18 pct on Swedish T-bill auction.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average accepted rate in an auction of seven-day Treasury bills was 3.18 percent, the National Debt Office said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The office had invited bids on Tuesday for a total 17 billion crowns ($2.3 billion).</p>
<p>The paper matures on March 5. -- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017 ($ = 7.397 Swedish Crowns)</p>
